{\b\fs28 Endpoint Status Checker v3.1.1-rc2}\par
{\i Release Candidate 2 \emdash  supersedes v3.1.1-rc1. This is a test build, not an official stable release.}\par
\par
{\b What's new vs RC1}\par
\bullet  New About screen \emdash  developer, version/build date, homepage and GitHub v3 links, a release-channel badge, and background music that never overlaps tracks.\par
\bullet  VirusTotal scans are skipped automatically for local/private addresses, with a manual flag for cases that can't be determined; scan failures now report clearly instead of risking a crash.\par
\bullet  Fixed a scan-progress color flicker during active scans.\par
\bullet  Fixed "response ended prematurely" failures against servers such as httpstat.us.\par
\bullet  Replaced the retired ftp.debian.org sample entry with test.rebex.net.\par
\bullet  Hardened the manual updater tool against a failed download/extract leaving it frozen.\par
\bullet  The in-app updater now checks a feed specific to this major version, with a mandatory confirmation before installing any test build \emdash  it is never applied silently.\par
\par
Full details: https://github.com/ThePhOeNiX810815/Endpoint-Status-Checker/blob/Main-Dev-V3/CHANGELOG.md\par
